    - rid: 2954408721239769089
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId:
          low: 6851099070375954371
          high: 7223058082028297833
        editorPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
        speakerName: Mayor Thaddeus
        text: The Deep Dark is quiet, and Barrow's End still stands. I did not think any squad could do it. The town owes you more than gold -- you will always have a bed at the Restful Hearth.
        nextNodeId:
          low: -6674083795254070407
          high: -8775704770207652925
    - rid: 2954408721239769090
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId:
          low: -6116595504972208326
          high: -961846010939578399
        editorPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
        speakerName: Mayor Thaddeus
        text: I see the new mercenary squad has finally arrived. The caverns beneath Barrow's End are crawling with hostiles. Are you properly equipped to handle this, or are you just here to waste my time?
        nextNodeId:
          low: -3542742179009036045
          high: -8333625937336966343
    - rid: 2954408721239769091
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId:
          low: -3542742179009036045
          high: -8333625937336966343
        editorPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
        options:
        - text: We have our squad and our supplies. We are ready to descend.
          nextNodeId:
            low: -5290639410534997749
            high: -1329972510102117419
          hasVisibilityCondition: 0
          timelineKey: 
          secondTimelineKey: 
          conditionType: 0
          threshold: 0
        - text: What exactly is down there?
          nextNodeId:
            low: 6853798793414543926
            high: 1457862725361840005
          hasVisibilityCondition: 0
          timelineKey: 
          secondTimelineKey: 
